        11/3/71                                                         WHO (I)


NAME              who -- who is on the system

SYNOPSIS          who

DESCRIPTION       who lists the name, typewriter channel, and login time for
                  each current UNIX user.

FILES             /tmp/utmp contains the necessary information; it is
                  maintained by init,

SEE ALSO          /etc/init

